				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-660980/long-live-the-king#post-4132087</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 27 Jan 2019 02:59:21 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Monteparnas</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2926286</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>You would barely feel the cyanide you'd get from a couple apples worth of seeds.</p> <p>But on the throat alone they found more than enough apple seeds to kill an adult in minutes if all the amygdalin was ingested. Even being unlikely that Dr. King actually absorbed the poison of most of the seeds, it should be amazing he didn't got any lasting health issues from so much cyanide poisoning.</p> <p>Also, he could try to kill himself far easier just by chewing around 200 seeds, not an unreasonable task at his current state.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
