					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-660980#post-1796605</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-660980/long-live-the-king#post-1796605</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 14 Jun 2013 17:42:23 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>wishun</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1204404</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I don't care for it.<br /> Maybe it would be different if I got the Dr. King/apple seeds thing. But I never have; and so this misses me by a wide margin.</p> <p>Plus, the grammer in the opening note annoyed me. I assume it's intentional, sign of a man under stress and all that, but it didn't read like something an educated &quot;man of science&quot; woudl write.</p> <p>Plus more, he locked himself in his office for <em>six weeks</em> and nobody did anything? I realize wacky staff hijinks are sometimes taken for a given, but you'd think someone would at least be annoyed he wasn't returning their e-mails.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
