					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It starts out neat enough. Then it turns to bees. Then it ends with characters shouting exposure and punchlines.</p> <p>I feel I'm one of the few who actually doesn't mind endless rehashes of similar concepts (I adore &quot;Six Faces&quot;, which is cubes-for-bees), but the apple-king doesn't have the punch of the corn-angel, and apple seeds are no match for bees.</p> <p>It's just too indistinct in storyline to really keep my interest going.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
